---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ArrowUpRight, Check, FileText, ArrowRight, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';
---
<Layout title="叙职 AIResume — 把做过的事，写得更清楚">
  <div class="landing">
    <header class="site-header page-width">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="叙职首页"><span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><strong>叙职</strong><span class="brand-en">AIResume</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#how-it-works">如何修改</a><a href="/privacy/">隐私说明</a><a class="nav-start" href="/app/">打开工作台<ArrowUpRight size={15} /></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero page-width">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="audience">为应届生与校招生准备</p>
          <h1>把做过的事，<br />写得更清楚。</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">带上一份简历和目标岗位。一起找到值得展开的经历，把每一句修改，落回真实的依据。</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary large" href="/app/">开始修改简历<ArrowUpRight size={18} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/app/?demo=1">先看一个例子</a></div>
          <p class="hero-note"><span><Check size={14} />无需注册</span><span><Check size={14} />导出 Word 文档</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stage" aria-label="虚构简历的改写示例">
          <div class="stage-tab"><span class="tiny-document"><FileText size={14} /></span><span>校园项目经历.docx</span><span class="example-label">虚构示例</span></div>
          <div class="hero-paper">
            <div class="paper-person"><span>陈同学</span><small>应届毕业生 / 产品经理方向</small></div>
            <div class="paper-rule"></div><p class="paper-section">项目经历</p>
            <h2>校园二手交易平台</h2><p class="paper-date">课程项目 · 需求分析与原型设计</p>
            <div class="before-copy"><span class="margin-label">原文</span><p>访谈同学并整理需求，梳理发布和检索流程，完成平台原型。</p></div>
            <div class="after-copy"><span class="margin-label">改写</span><p>围绕校园二手交易场景，<mark>访谈同学并整理需求</mark>；梳理物品发布与检索流程，<mark>输出产品原型</mark>。</p></div>
            <div class="paper-bottom"><span>保留你做过的事</span><Check size={14} /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="annotation"><span class="annotation-pin"></span><p>先说清场景，再写个人行动。<br /><strong>没有提供的成果，不替你编。</strong></p></div>
          <div class="jd-strip"><span>岗位依据</span><p>“能够进行需求分析，并将需求转化为产品原型。”</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="how-it-works" class="process-section">
        <div class="page-width process-layout">
          <div><p class="section-kicker">从一份现有简历开始</p><h2>有依据地改。<br />每一步，由你决定。</h2></div>
          <ol class="process-list">
            <li><span class="process-number">1</span><div><h3>放入简历与岗位</h3><p>上传 Word 或文字型 PDF，粘贴岗位职责和要求。先核对读取到的简历内容。</p></div></li>
            <li><span class="process-number">2</span><div><h3>逐条检查，选择采纳</h3><p>对照简历原句和岗位依据。采纳、跳过，也可以亲手修改措辞。</p></div></li>
            <li><span class="process-number">3</span><div><h3>整理成可以投递的一份</h3><p>预览统一的简洁版式，下载可继续编辑的 Word 文档。</p></div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="closing-section page-width">
        <div class="privacy-caption"><ShieldCheck size={23} /><p>你的经历，只用于这次修改。<br /><a href="/privacy/">了解数据处理与删除规则</a></p></div>
        <div><h2>下一次投递前，<br />先把自己讲清楚。</h2><a class="button primary" href="/app/">打开简历工作台<ArrowRight size={17}/></a></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer page-width"><a class="brand small" href="/"><strong>叙职</strong><span class="brand-en">AIResume</span></a><span>真实的经历，清楚的表达。</span><a href="/privacy/">隐私说明</a></footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
